              "This module provides Python bindings for the NLM brain simulation framework.\n\n"
              "Basic Usage:\n"
              "  import pynlm\n"
              "  config = pynlm.createDefaultConfig()\n"
              "  brain = pynlm.createBrain(config)\n"
              "  brain.initialize()\n"
              "  for i in range(1000):\n"
              "      brain.step(i)\n\n"
              "For more examples, see HOW_TO_USE.md and easy_usage.md\n"
              "in the project documentation.";
